枉相招。\n尚忝仆臣正，谁云淹下僚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22377,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行酬别徐鸣卿武选四首并次来韵 其三","author":"区大相","text":"长筹君恋阙，小草我怀山。\n微禄堪司驭，前贤滞抱关。\n官曹殊翰墨，职事等优闲。\n犹愧鸱夷子，轻舟去不还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22378,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行酬别徐鸣卿武选四首并次来韵 其四","author":"区大相","text":"谐世元无术，因君为决疑。\n物情嫌太洁，吾道贵希知。\n未有为霖日，谁怜失路时。\n赐环非敢拟，鸣佩更何期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22379,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟夜小集 其一","author":"区大相","text":"前林开复合，远浦去还停。\n霭澹沙增白，霜多树减青。\n举杯兼得月，拂棹乱看星。\n客意闲如水，沿洄白鹭汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22380,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟夜小集 其二","author":"区大相","text":"上客谈方剧，秋杯夜未阑。\n傍林迷曲岸，乘月爱清澜。\n往事悬河尽，新诗秉烛看。\n穷途惟仗醉，能解百忧端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22381,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟夜小集 其三","author":"区大相","text":"秋晚鸿声急，更深烛影斜。\n寒风彫翠柳，古岸隐苍葭。\n沦落冲星剑，逍遥贯月槎。\n醉来望牛斗，何处是京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22382,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟夜小集 其四","author":"区大相","text":"落叶下河津，萧萧旅雁宾。\n管弦愁送客，风月忆归人。\n旧国苍山远，秋衣白露新。\n琴边有流水，聊与涤淄尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22383,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其一","author":"区大相","text":"从来寥廓意，不为众人言。\n白日照燕阙，黄云迷蓟原。\n未陈济代略，虚负明君恩。\n嗛嗛羞章绶，依依去国门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22384,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其二","author":"区大相","text":"人生各有适，岂不常欢然。\n荣瘁安由命，行藏敢问天。\n百年恒道路，万里足风烟。\n去去复何戚，离心魏阙前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22385,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其三","author":"区大相","text":"咄咄坐遥夜，忧端不可论。\n常将心问影，频使别销魂。\n月矫惊弦雁，风号失水猿。\n谁能更奋翼，长策献君门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22386,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其四","author":"区大相","text":"独客黯无语，深更坐转幽。\n愁心偏畏夜，颓鬓不禁秋。\n国事凭黄口，皇恩眷白头。\n雷同人总喜，藿食尔何忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22387,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其五","author":"区大相","text":"懒觉投簪便，秋应伏枕宜。\n微名从渐损，病骨不堪支。\n日踬骅骝步，霜催蒲柳姿。\n因知摇落理，偏向长年悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22388,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其六","author":"区大相","text":"悠悠去何事，独夜少为欢。\n索索风枝劲，凄凄露草漙。\n思来无一可，愁至有千端。\n夕寝不遑寐，时危敢自安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22389,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其七","author":"区大相","text":"闻道貂珰辈，由来为扫除。\n先朝停镇守，近日典方舆。\n贡采山川竭，徵输井邑虚。\n明明皇祖训，宫府意何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22390,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其八","author":"区大相","text":"河决惟徐兖，萧条郡国同。\n堤防年倍费，薪竹岁论功。\n巨浸连天阔，横流出地洪。\n怀襄无过此，谁为达宸聪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22391,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其九","author":"区大相","text":"厥贡元称下，荒年亦自输。\n但闻鬻妻子，宁复问田庐。\n水土司空职，漕渠太史书。\n何时睹河洛，万姓免为鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22392,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其十","author":"区大相","text":"每岁中官出，人思答圣情。\n闾阎敛愁叹，神鬼害骄盈。\n不复忧天坠，何曾见海平。\n愚夫劳过计，小物有微诚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22393,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其十一","author":"区大相","text":"憔悴沿河驿，萧条古岸杨。\n近年添进奉，连岁属凶荒。\n官舸追呼急，胥徒匿走藏。\n传餐吾已愧，谁忍困流亡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22394,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其十二","author":"区大相","text":"驿小欺淩易，财殚供亿难。\n虽疲邮宰力，犹失上官欢。\n鼓吹连樯动，闾阎疾首看。\n传言来往使，慎勿念加餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22395,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其十三","author":"区大相","text":"夏镇距徐方，徐关接凤阳。\n玄夷书未授，苍水使相望。\n根本元称重，咽喉亦虑伤。\n三年道傍议，何日筑宣房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22396,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其十四","author":"区大相","text":"万方皆入贡，四海久销兵。\n拘士偷安计，微臣忧乱萌。\n天灾常不验，时变屡空惊。\n窃有处堂喻，将无曲突情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22397,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其十五","author":"区大相","text":"屡疲中国力，每岁事匈奴。\n贡市名虽美，金绘实岂殊。\n胡儿披锦绣，汉厩得龙驹。\n近道边防撤，渝盟亦可虞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22398,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行感怀四十首 其十六","author":"区大相","text":"尝闻六国日，富盛数齐燕。\n带甲动百万，粟支常十年。\n迩来军国计，仰给越吴船。\n塞北多屯地，京东足水田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22399,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]